    "note": "The reader's governing instruction is the shipped skill file, loaded by path (sha256 verifiable against the committed file), applied under the 'grounded' inference stance the skill defines. A general output-format contract (INSUFFICIENT token + conciseness) is appended so answers are machine-scorable. skills/retrieval.md is not loaded: the reader issues no retrieval calls, so that guidance does not apply. The retrieval envelope is presented to the reader via render_envelope ('rendered_prose_v2': clean rank-ordered prose, scaffolding omitted, content faithful); envelope_bytes/sha256 still measure the canonical json envelope (the retrieval payload), of which the rendered input is a deterministic function.",
